title: "SchemaAware-NL2SQL: Cross-Domain Natural Language to SQL Using Schema-Only Architecture"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2024-11-01
url: "https://github.com/SharmilaChandariah/SchemaAware-NL2SQL"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - natural-language-processing
  - text-to-sql
  - schema-aware
  - enterprise-ai
  - generative-ai
  - large-language-models
  - sql-generation
  - cross-domain
abstract: 
  A GenAI-based Text-to-SQL system that generates accurate SQL queries
  from natural language using only the database schema — no hardcoded
  table knowledge, no sample queries, and no schema-specific fine-tuning
  required. The schema-only architecture enables cross-domain deployment
  across any relational database without modification. Successfully
  deployed as the first enterprise-wide GenAI solution at a major
  client organization.
notes: "Presented as keynote at the IEEE Region 4 Nexus Conference, Milwaukee School of Engineering, Wisconsin, November 2024."
